cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Quickbeam in your work, please cite it using these metadata.
title: Quickbeam
type: software
abstract: >-
  A C++20 micro-benchmarking library with Python bindings that measures timing
  distributions and hardware counters to explain why code is slow, not just
  how long it takes.
authors:
  - given-names: Kai
    family-names: Striega
    email: me@kaistriega.com
repository-code: https://github.com/Kai-Striega/Quickbeam
url: https://quickbeam.readthedocs.io
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - benchmarking
  - micro-benchmarking
  - performance
  - hardware counters
  - C++
  - Python
# Keep in sync with meson.build; the release workflow checks it.
version: 0.1.0
